# Linux Git Installation on Storage Server

**Objective:** Install Git on the Storage Server and create a Git repository for the new application project.

**Requirements:**

- Install Git using `yum` package manager.
- Set up a bare Git repository named `/opt/games.git` on the Storage Server.

